        "id": 103932,
        "name": "LevelUpLeo",
        "username": "LevelUpLeo",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/levelupleo/{size}/2394_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-05-19T13:00:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The wording is different though. Stealth reads</p><p>\"Reduce the next damage that would be dealt to the Wraith by 2\"</p><p>This is clear that the next 1 instance of damage would be reduced by 2.</p><p>The ability being discussed reads</p><p>\"Prevent the next 2 damage dealt to that hero\"</p><p>As the OP pointed out, its really ambugious compared to other similar abilities. Doesn't say that it only activates the next time a hero would be damage, just \"the next 2 damage\". Sounds to me like it could prevent 1 damage from 1 attack, and then another 1 damage from another attack as those would be the next 2 damage dealt to that hero.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
